  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 1401.03 Standard Terms. Any terms used in this chapter that are subject to Env-Dw 101.03 or that are defined in Env-Dw 103 shall have the meaning established therein unless otherwise specified herein.\n\nSource. #13164, eff 1-26-21; ss by #13372, eff 4-21-22",
